cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SHMtrace, please cite the software and the article describing it."
title: "SHMtrace: control-calibrated profiling of somatic hypermutation"
abstract: >-
  SHMtrace measures somatic hypermutation from amplicon reads on any platform (nanopore, PacBio,
  Illumina, Sanger) by testing each candidate mutation against the errors of matched AID-null
  libraries from the same run, with a control-based false-discovery threshold and animal-level
  group tests.
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-13
license: MIT
